# {{.Type}} {{.Name}}

Manages a single privilege grant on a Spanner resource to a database role, as part of
[fine-grained access control (FGAC)](https://cloud.google.com/spanner/docs/fgac-about). Which
privileges are valid for a given `resource_type` is documented at
https://cloud.google.com/spanner/docs/fgac-privileges. Spanner has no `ALTER GRANT` DDL, so
changing any attribute (including `columns`) forces the grant to be revoked and re-granted rather
than updated in place.

Granting a role to another role (role membership) is not supported by this resource - only
resource privilege grants are.

